OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly this
OL,6,Fevening, a few showers in the
OL,7,Fnorthwest. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be largely dry with clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Chilly in some sheltered
OL,10,Fglens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FDry for most of the day
OL,13,Fbefore rain spreads northeast in the
OL,14,Fevening. Some bright spells but
OL,15,Fclouding over from the south during
OL,16,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
